@WebAPIGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:8085

### Health
GET {{WebAPIGateway_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login (anonymous via Identity)
POST {{WebAPIGateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@identity.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345!"
}

### Protected Candidate route (set token from login response)
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

POST {{WebAPIGateway_HostAddress}}/api/candidates/get-list
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Protected Roles route (Admin)
GET {{WebAPIGateway_HostAddress}}/api/roles/user/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
